OL,3,GNEWSACity centre quad bikes spark fear
OL,4,Aof harm to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of quad bikes weaving through
OL,7,Fcity centre traffic, running red lights
OL,8,Fand almost hitting pedestrians has
OL,9,Fsparked fears that people could be
OL,10,Fseriously hurt unless action is taken.
OL,12,FOne Birmingham resident filmed the
OL,13,Fbikers on Hurst Street at about 18:00
OL,14,FBST on Sunday, with the bikes said to
OL,15,Freturn to the road about three hours
OL,16,Flater.
OL,18,FHe described the situation as a
OL,19,F"regular occurrence, a noise nuisance
OL,20,Fand dangerous" as the culprits operated
OL,21,F"without fear of what's ahead".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
